  "details": "I'd like almost all groups I'm part of to be hidden because I enjoy my privacy.\n\nCurrently when joining a group it's automatically shown to everyone on your profile, however I'd like for them to be hidden by default and to manually decide which groups I display in my profile. It would nice for this to be an option.\n\nIt's not too much of a problem for groups that you can just join straight away since you can then hide it immediately, but for groups you request to join they'll be displayed on your profile until you realise you've been accepted into them.",
